{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在尖沙咀截查一輛私家車，司機涉嫌停牌期間駕駛等罪名被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉案私家車停在馬路中心，男司機被手銬反鎖，多名警員搜查車尾箱及副駕等位置。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">昨日深夜11時許，一輛私家車沿漆咸道南往油麻地方向行駛，途經近柯士甸道時，警方見到該車的車窗呈黑色，認為有可疑而截車搜查。據了解，涉案司機通過藥物及酒精呼氣測試，但之前已被永久停牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST-0100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20262XOYoY3J0q1784411914.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ARREST-0100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T22:18:28.384384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}